; sift.mongo — the opt-in Mongo TOOLKIT that ships with Sift: the pure data-shape→Bson-artifact
; vocabulary built on a Sift codec. Filter / Update / Sort (selectors, update modifiers, sort docs),
; Index (key specs), Json_schema ($jsonSchema rendered from Sift's view), Projection (typed
; projections), Def (the collection declaration: name + codec + indexes + validator). All PURE +
; instance-free + jsoo-safe — no store, no connection, no runtime (that fusion is fennec's job).
; Unwrapped, so userland reads Filter.eq / Def.v directly.
(library
 (name fennec_pulse_sift_mongo)
 (public_name fennec.pulse.sift.mongo)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries fennec-mongo.bson fennec.pulse.sift))
